# ISP Web Frontend Rules

**Goal: premium ISP Pay BD platform — NOT a generic CRM.** Complete, professional, modern.

Read before ANY code:
1. `docs/PROJECT-MEMORY.md`
2. `docs/13-STRICT-AGENT-MANDATE.md`
3. `docs/QUALITY-STANDARDS.md`
4. `docs/UI-FUSION-GUIDE.md`
5. `docs/MASTER-BUILD-PLAN.md` — check current phase

## UI fusion (two surfaces)

| Surface | Stack |
|---------|-------|
| **Marketing** | ISP `landing.css` dark (`#0c0118`, CTA `#f75803`, accent `#2E8BFF`) + [21st.dev](https://21st.dev/community/components) + Framer Motion |
| **Portals** | shadcn/ui + ISP tokens (`#f75803`, `#1a0b38`, Satoshi) |

- Landing: dark-only, 28 sections, ≥90% PHP parity
- Portals: polished shadcn, full ISP sidebar, TanStack Table
- NO generic CRM dashboards, NO lorem ipsum, NO placeholder-only screens

## Quality (mandatory on every screen)

- All 4 states: loading skeleton, empty, error, success
- Responsive: 320px → 1440px
- Permissions: nav filter + route guard + `<Can>` on buttons
- ISP domain copy from `isppaybd_isp` reference
- Pass `docs/DEFINITION-OF-DONE.md` before marking done

## Scope (Phase 1)

- Static mock data ONLY — `src/data/` via mock-api
- NEVER import `@/data` in features/components
- All fonts/images local in `public/`
- Mirror all portals from `isppaybd_isp` sidebar

## Architecture

- One feature = one folder under `src/features/{portal}/{module}/`
- Pages in `features/.../pages/` — app routes thin (~3 lines)
- Tests in `tests/` — never inside `src/app/`

## Phase gate

- **P0 must complete before Phase 1 landing code**
- P0 = tokens, fonts, MarketingLayout, shared components, full nav config
- See `docs/MASTER-BUILD-PLAN.md`

## Do not

- Modify `isppaybd_isp` during frontend-only work
- Commit unless user asks
- Skip phases or quality gates
- Mark screens done without DoD + verify commands
- Build generic template UI
